{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Magic is dying from the world... but still, there are the Immortal Magi.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In<i> Immortal Magus,</i> you as one of the titular sorcerers must save ancient Britain from the demon, Mephisto.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is a throwback to a nigh-forgotten subgenre of strategy games, called 'artillery games.' You must throw projectiles at your opponents to eliminate them - carefully calculating the trajectory, and the effect of the wind. A variety of different spells (which act as the projectiles) can be used to defeat your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">voice-acted Story mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">customizable two-player Skirmish mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">destructible environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">variety of different spells, including a Spell Editor in Story Mode to craft your own</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">multitude of Units to create</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704560/extras/immortal_magus_clip.gif?t=1746269269\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3704560?t=1746269269","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3704560?t=1746269269","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704560/a5844fe536cf55208248cff2cb529ed99b6a9776/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746269269","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704560/a5844fe536cf55208248cff2cb529ed99b6a9776/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746269269","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP",